title: >-
  Terrain-Informed Random Forest, CNN, and Cellular Automata for Mapping and
  Forecasting Delhi Yamuna Floodplain Encroachment
message: >-
  The manuscript is unpublished and under preparation. If you use this code,
  the floodplain polygon or the figures, please cite the entry below and check
